{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRIME. POWER. MONEY. RESPECT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PROJECT OVERLAW is an online multiplayer crime RPG shooter set in a modern open city. A sandbox where freelancers, gangs, and solo operators fight for money, gear, and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No classes. Build your character your way. Level up skills, gear up, and hit the streets. Whether you run solo or squad up, it\u2019s all about risk and reward. Fight on the streets and get paid. Whether it's the law or the bandits, you\u2019ll have to watch out for both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a looter shooter with MMO vibes. You spawn in, load up, and step into a living crime world. Hustle hard, shoot it out, and walk away richer... if you make it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer third-person shooter with PvP and PvE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classless skill system: Offense, Defense, Stealth, Intelligence, Mobility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fluid movement with vaulting, climbing, parkour-style traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recoil-based gunplay, hit feedback, and tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot-driven progression. Take gear, stack cash, build loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open urban city map with interiors, rooftops, and streets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles, economy systems, and more in development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRIME. POWER. MONEY. RESPECT.</strong><br><strong>That\u2019s the game.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844480?t=1751560978","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844480?t=1751560978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844480/7ac089892804